## 📖 Overview

This repository contains **50 SQL practice questions** focused on **GROUP BY**, **HAVING**, **ORDER BY**, **WHERE**, **Aggregate Functions**, **Multi-Column GROUP BY**, and **Date Functions**.

The exercises are based on a sample **Employees** table containing **50 records** and are designed to strengthen SQL aggregation and reporting skills.

